>> title: Borscht
>> category: Soups
>> tags: beets, beef, cabbage, ukrainian, stovetop, winter
>> servings: 6
>> time: 2 hr 15 min
>> step.1: brown 10 min
>> step.2: simmer 1 1/2 hr, pull the meat
>> step.3: sweat 8 min
>> step.4: cook 10 min
>> step.5: simmer 20 min
>> step.6: season, sour cream at the table

Brown @beef short ribs{2%lb}(900 g; bone-in) in a #Dutch oven{} in their own fat for ~{10%min}.

Simmer @&(~1)short ribs{} in @beef stock{8%cups}(1.9 L) for ~{90%min}, then pull the meat off the bones and discard them.

Sweat @yellow onion{1%large} and @carrot{1%large}(grated) in @unsalted butter{2%Tbs} for ~{8%min}.

Cook @&(~1)vegetables{} for ~{10%min} with @beets{1 1/2%lb}(700 g; peeled and grated), @tomato paste{2%Tbs}, and @cider vinegar{2%Tbs}.

Simmer @&(~3)beef broth{} and @&(~1)beets{} for ~{20%min} with @russet potatoes{3/4%lb}(340 g; cubed) and @green cabbage{3%cups}(shredded).

Season @&(~1)borscht{} with @garlic{2%cloves}(minced), @kosher salt{2%tsp}, and @fresh dill{3%Tbs}(chopped), and pass @sour cream{2/3%cup}(160 g) at the table.
